+//   S1 = sum_c dp sp[c], S2 = sum_c dp (p - ep[c]) per token -> S1 / S2 [M] (written once: no zeroing);
+//   (the channel sums r0 = sum_m dp, r1 = sum_m dp rs_o mu_o come out of the dWp GEMM's extra columns). cnt: colsum3's arrival counters (256 words), zeroed by CTA 0. Token-tile grouped schedule: a CTA runs every channel item of
